{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"ae9fe4efe1778942d65a377fe6445075bc0e1ad3f65dd25914954f7d8a4b929c","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"7859e3f094ccf4120f114289ac4e2ea0a9fd3be9632fedfe4cdafca4ae397e1f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"78772bb5d781ced3776febb55c1d4b111c1d908a2d029293a465338e35d56324","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"7896895e1d2ee97cf0241783873aa3368c2a470625524d064e1dea4b2a10022d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“绝望”未表达原文的精神失常含义。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/cursed/punishments.lua:311–344：技能名为 Madness，说明明确为 going mad；doMadness 施加 MADNESS_CONFUSED、MADNESS_STUNNED 或 MADNESS_SLOW，与丧失希望的“绝望”语义不同。"},{"revision_key":"789792c3601147102268f69cf6d2868f9b7e7b0e016d4e986d43724b45a912fd","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"78bd1d3c45cfb9489bd9f8c1b5ed7a083277072a1c783c78ac127a47d28be272","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"强度3的“对10范围内的一个随机敌人进行报复”与固定源码的目标选择不符，英文说明也存在此偏差。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/other.lua:1517–1547：callbackOnTemporaryEffect 在 p.src 为 actor 时直接对该来源造成精神及暗影伤害，不作10格限制；仅缺少 actor 来源时才从10格内随机选择敌人。译文遗漏了优先反击效果来源的分支。"},{"revision_key":"78bede0fabaa224e615bd888c80fde61c0ff670cc863eca77e3d08df37155311","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"78d59a966c5df57f966a6327e381acd0392eded473dde6cca5c739c41b9b2f0d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“一次精神训练”把长期心智生活改成了一次训练事件。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/psionic/mental-discipline.lua:78–98：Highly Trained Mind 为被动技能，说明使用 A life of the mind 描述长期积累；原文没有“一次”的限定。"},{"revision_key":"78eb7497c60e85aa22ebae5b0636679e6d9559d5ca747b2a3b815e8e1eb5cb7b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"冻结输入所引 tome 源码 game/modules/tome/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:325（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）写的是 humanoid teeth，译为“人类牙齿”将类人生物缩窄为人类；One would have to assume 表明牙齿归属属于推测，译文“那些牙齿并非……而是……”又将其改成确定事实。"},{"revision_key":"78f5c8d8d6e36f81b98ec42b135b630bf670b4bb07f774d50e508be93fcf72a1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"78fc88db2e9a069b91835e0347c7bbb123b7e872a8e5effbb2e2c009a7aba523","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“烟雾弹”把烟雾效果改成了投掷物。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/damage_types.lua:4127–4137：该字符串由 SMOKESCREEN.projector 写入 delayedLogDamage，标记烟幕作用于目标并施加 DIM_VISION 的效果；原文 smoke 指烟雾，没有“弹”的对象含义。"},{"revision_key":"790ee92ca568a049efdd4100530607a44f1c7fe4fa78b54c89172ac4447dfb40","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"790f9ecd0231c04be401752a7927a81fc88cc317f56e9da2102c86000aa429d9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"冻结输入所引 tome 源码 game/modules/tome/data/birth/classes/wilder.lua:262（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）明确包含 the worship of nature，即对自然的崇拜；“训练……自然力量”仅表达力量修习，遗漏了职业背景中的自然崇拜关系。"},{"revision_key":"7965db04ff1cc55edd9d02055dc2730c3a853fd94915b6d30b6b93f07bb2da84","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文遗漏“包括某些技能的额外打击”，并将 archery damage 简化为无基准的“伤害”。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/excellence.lua:151–179：proc 对同一目标的后续调用返回 true，archeryShoot 使用 combatTalentWeaponDamage 作为倍率；第177行明确说明额外打击也被中断、百分比为射击伤害。"},{"revision_key":"79698c8d00a8caeef2de05e3b9ddaba0a7104d9f8a7aab38604927b6dece3c37","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文把选定目标作为恐惧辐射中心、驱逐其周围其他生物的关系改成了直接恐惧范围内目标，遗漏作用中心。补查 tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/cursed/dark-figure.lua:33–52：先选取单个 target，再通过 target:setEffect(EFF_RADIANT_FEAR, duration, {radius=radius,...}) 将效果附于该目标；说明明确为 Fear radiates from your target。"}]}